nd the money has gone. They learn that the car driver was Greg Nesterenko, a member of the Satan's Bulls. Officers Julie Robert and Martin Hervieux begin their investigation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9DRJaS6oJ8jIri4dGmDhorSwAP0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-01\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Intruder\",\"overview\":\"Karl and Max realize the seriousness of their situation. Max wants to protect his girlfriend Dominique by keeping the truth from her, but the situation undermines their relationship as a couple. Flower, the hitman, is looking for clues at Heron Lake. He finds Yvon's chalet.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qWcMFkSeAGyYn9N9fNHfWeSBzFw.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-01\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Double-Dealing\",\"overview\":\"Max and Karl receive an unpleasant surprise visit from Flower, who gives them an ultimatum: they've got 24 hours to get the money.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wvcuj7cgqn1ls562DSb1O2yYlZC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-01\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"No Smoke Without Fire\",\"overview\":\"Jacob has vanished. Max believes he's been kidnapped by Flower, but dare not tell Dominique. Confronted by Karl, Flower decides to help Max to find his son.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iDLLjHWKojhZXnoeGf6L3VFxpm2.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-01\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"A Fox Among the Geese\",\"overview\":\"Max and Flower come to the aid of Karl, held prisoner by Greg Nesterenko. Julie Robert continues her enquiries, which lead her to Lou Guérard, the leader of the Satan's Bulls.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cDq6PtTPtwo6bbPGjsN44j6PzHp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-01\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Big Wheel and the Brunette\",\"overview\":\"Karl and Max 